flowchart TD
    START[/Approved spec from /specs/] --> PLAN1
    subgraph PLAN ["/plan: slices, Gherkin, critics"]
        PLAN1[Read spec artifacts] --> SLICE[Decompose into vertical slices]
        SLICE --> GHERKIN[Author Gherkin per slice: happy, negative, edge, error]
        GHERKIN --> WAVES[plan_waves.py derives the parallelization DAG]
        WAVES --> TIER{Plan tier?}
        TIER -->|trivial| R1[Dispatch acceptance critic]
        TIER -->|standard| R2[Dispatch acceptance, design, plus UX and parallelization as needed]
        TIER -->|complex| R5[Dispatch all five critics]
        R1 --> VERDICT{Any needs-revision?}
        R2 --> VERDICT
        R5 --> VERDICT
        VERDICT -->|yes, max 2 rounds| REVISE[Revise plan, re-run flagged critics]
        REVISE --> VERDICT
        VERDICT -->|no| SUMMARY[Append Plan Review Summary]
    end

    SUMMARY --> APPROVE[/User: approve or request changes/]
    APPROVE -->|changes| SLICE
    APPROVE -->|approved| EXPORT[Export .feature files, offer slice issues]
    EXPORT --> BUILD[/Hand off to /build/]
